<body>
<main class="mdf-document"><span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># libmdf Deck Mode</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Centered Front Page With More Content</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;font-size:22pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:3ch;">## Subtitle Block</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">This slide verifies that the first slide can include more than a single heading while still centering the content block.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Stable Heading Scale</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;font-size:22pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:3ch;">## Second-Level Heading</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;font-size:15pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:4ch;">### Third-Level Heading</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(205,205,0);font-size:14pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:5ch;">#### Fourth-Level Heading</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:13pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:6ch;">##### Fifth-Level Heading</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(220,220,220);font-size:12.5pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:7ch;">###### Sixth-Level Heading</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">ATX headings should remain stable from slide to slide while body content participates in autofit.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Header And Body Heading Paths</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Body First-Level Heading</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;font-size:22pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:3ch;">## Body Second-Level Heading</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;font-size:15pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:4ch;">### Body Third-Level Heading</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(205,205,0);font-size:14pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:5ch;">#### Body Fourth-Level Heading</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:13pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:6ch;">##### Body Fifth-Level Heading</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">This paragraph verifies that headings in the slide body use the body-heading scale instead of the promoted slide-header scale. The smallest body heading on this slide should still read as a heading and must not become smaller than this paragraph text.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Sparse Body Autofit</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">One short paragraph should become comfortably large without looking like a marketing splash page.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Dense Body Autofit</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">This slide intentionally contains enough body content to force a smaller body font. The renderer should preserve readable spacing, keep headings predictable, and avoid clipping content in a typical fullscreen browser viewport.</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Autofit should treat this as normal slide content rather than a failure mode. If a slide is too dense even at the minimum font size, the fallback should be visually obvious and still allow the presenter to reach all content.</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">The goal is to test the everyday case where a technical presenter adds a little too much detail but still expects the deck to adapt gracefully on desktop and laptop screens.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Inline Markdown</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Plain text can include </span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-style:italic;">emphasis</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, </span><span style="color:rgb(229,229,229);font-weight:700;">strong text</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;font-style:italic;">combined emphasis</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">inline code</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, </span><a href="https://example.com/deck"><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">links</span></a><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, and autolinks like https://example.com/autolink.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Lists</span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Unordered item with a short label.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Unordered item with </span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-style:italic;">inline emphasis</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, </span><span style="color:rgb(229,229,229);font-weight:700;">strong text</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, and </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">inline code</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Unordered item with nested structure:</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">  </span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Nested unordered item.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">  </span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Nested item with </span><a href="https://example.com/nested"><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">a link</span></a><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">.</span></span></span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">1.</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Ordered item one.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">2.</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Ordered item two with a longer sentence that should wrap cleanly.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">3.</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Ordered item three.</span></span></span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Task Lists</span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> [ ] </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Unchecked task item.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> [x] </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Checked task item.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> [ ] </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Task item with enough text to wrap across more than one visual line when the browser viewport is narrow.</span></span></span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Task list rendering is a future Markdown extension in some contexts, so this slide also documents the desired visual target if task markers are supported.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Block Quotes</span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">A short quote should read as a distinct block.</span></span></span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">A longer quote should wrap cleanly and preserve the quote treatment across lines. It should not collide with the slide number indicator.</span></span></span>
<span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Quoted list item.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Another quoted list item with </span><span style="color:rgb(229,229,229);font-weight:700;">strong text</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">.</span></span></span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Code</span>

<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">int main(void)</span>
<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">{</span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">    </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">const char *boundary = &#34;---&#34;;</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">    </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">return boundary[0] == &#39;-&#39; ? 0 : 1;</span></span></span>
<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">}</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">The fenced </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">---</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> string above must not split the deck.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Preformatted Text</span>

<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">make test</span>
<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">cmdf --deck --slide-numbers -x fade -o deck.html testdata/deck-corpus/comprehensive.md</span>
<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">open deck.html</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Indented code should remain readable and should not participate in Markdown slide boundary parsing.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Tables</span>

<table class="mdf-table mdf-table-bordered"><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Capability</th><th style="text-align:center;">Desktop</th><th style="text-align:center;">Mobile</th><th style="text-align:left;">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;">Keyboard navigation</td><td style="text-align:center;">yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">yes</td><td style="text-align:left;">external keyboards should work</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">Touch navigation</td><td style="text-align:center;">yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">yes</td><td style="text-align:left;">horizontal and vertical swipes are supported</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">Autofit</td><td style="text-align:center;">yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">yes</td><td style="text-align:left;">body content adapts per slide</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">Charts</td><td style="text-align:center;">yes</td><td style="text-align:center;">yes</td><td style="text-align:left;">chart boxes stay inspectable</td></tr></tbody></table>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Wide Table Pressure</span>

<table class="mdf-table mdf-table-bordered"><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Column</th><th style="text-align:right;">Short</th><th style="text-align:left;">Medium length header</th><th style="text-align:left;">Long content pressure</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;">alpha</td><td style="text-align:right;">1</td><td style="text-align:left;">small</td><td style="text-align:left;">long text that should wrap inside the table cell without forcing the whole slide out of the viewport</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">beta</td><td style="text-align:right;">22</td><td style="text-align:left;">medium</td><td style="text-align:left;">another deliberately long table value with <span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">inline code</span> and <span style="color:rgb(229,229,229);font-weight:700;">strong text</span></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;">gamma</td><td style="text-align:right;">333</td><td style="text-align:left;">large</td><td style="text-align:left;"><a href="https://example.com/table/link"><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">a link with a descriptive label</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Horizontal Chart</span>
<div class="mdf-chart-block" style="width:100%;text-align:center;"><span class="mdf-chart-box" style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;">
<span class="mdf-line mdf-chart-line" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span class="mdf-prefix"></span><span class="mdf-content" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;">Implementation</span><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);"> <span style="display:inline-block;width:1ch;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;color:inherit;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% + .045em),transparent calc(50% + .045em));">│</span> </span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(0,205,0);">███████████████████████████████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;">42 42.0%</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line mdf-chart-line" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span class="mdf-prefix"></span><span class="mdf-content" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;">Verification</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">  </span><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);"> <span style="display:inline-block;width:1ch;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;color:inherit;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% + .045em),transparent calc(50% + .045em));">│</span> </span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(59,156,255);">███████████████████████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">         </span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;">31 31.0%</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line mdf-chart-line" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span class="mdf-prefix"></span><span class="mdf-content" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">Design</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">        </span><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);"> <span style="display:inline-block;width:1ch;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;color:inherit;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% + .045em),transparent calc(50% + .045em));">│</span> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,0,205);">█████████████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">                   </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">18 18.0%</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line mdf-chart-line" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span class="mdf-prefix"></span><span class="mdf-content" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(205,205,0);">Release</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">       </span><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);"> <span style="display:inline-block;width:1ch;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;color:inherit;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% + .045em),transparent calc(50% + .045em));">│</span> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,205,0);"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,205,0);">███████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">                         </span><span style="color:rgb(205,205,0);">9 9.0%</span></span></span>
</span></div>
