:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;">34.0%</span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);background-color:rgb(0,205,0);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(0,205,0);">██████████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);background-color:rgb(59,156,255);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(59,156,255);">███████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(59,156,255);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;">27.0%</span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);background-color:rgb(59,156,255);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(59,156,255);">████████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);background-color:rgb(205,0,205);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,0,205);">█████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(205,0,205);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;">21.0%</span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);background-color:rgb(205,0,205);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,0,205);">█████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(205,205,0);background-color:rgb(205,205,0);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,205,0);">████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(205,205,0);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;">18.0%</span><span style="color:rgb(205,205,0);background-color:rgb(205,205,0);display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,205,0);">████</span></span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line mdf-chart-line" style="display:block;white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:center;"><span class="mdf-prefix"></span><span class="mdf-content" style="display:inline-block;white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;">■</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;">Renderer</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;">34</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">  </span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;">■</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;">Tests</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;">27</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">  </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">■</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">Parser</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">21</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">  </span><span style="color:rgb(205,205,0);">■</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,205,0);">CLI</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,205,0);">18</span></span></span></span></div>
<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Chart In Quote</span>

<div class="mdf-chart-block" style="width:100%;text-align:center;"><span class="mdf-chart-box" style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;"><span class="mdf-line mdf-chart-line" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span class="mdf-prefix"></span><span class="mdf-content" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">Explicit</span><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);"> <span style="display:inline-block;width:1ch;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;color:inherit;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% + .045em),transparent calc(50% + .045em));">│</span> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,0,205);">████████████████████████████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">          </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">40 40.0%</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line mdf-chart-line" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span class="mdf-prefix"></span><span class="mdf-content" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">Magic</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">   </span><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);"> <span style="display:inline-block;width:1ch;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;color:inherit;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% + .045em),transparent calc(50% + .045em));">│</span> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,0,205);">█████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">                                 </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">7 7.0%</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line mdf-chart-line" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span class="mdf-prefix"></span><span class="mdf-content" style="white-space:pre;overflow-wrap:normal;text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">Evidence</span><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);"> <span style="display:inline-block;width:1ch;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;color:inherit;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% - .045em),currentColor calc(50% + .045em),transparent calc(50% + .045em));">│</span> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;"><span style="display:inline-block;height:1lh;line-height:1lh;vertical-align:top;white-space:pre;color:transparent;background-color:rgb(205,0,205);">█████████████████████████████████████</span></span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;">53 53.0%</span></span></span>
</span></div>
<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Quoted charts should inherit the surrounding container treatment without breaking chart layout.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Mixed Technical Slide</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;font-size:22pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:3ch;">## Release Checklist</span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">1.</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">API options initialized by </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">mdf_options_init</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">2.</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">CLI validates </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">--transition</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> before rendering.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">3.</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">MDF_FORMAT_HTML</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> output remains unchanged.</span></span></span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">4.</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">MDF_FORMAT_HTML_DECK</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> emits deck shell, CSS, and JavaScript.</span></span></span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">The deck renderer may materialize one slide at a time, but ordinary HTML mode should not inherit deck-only behavior.</span></span></span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Thematic Break Edge Cases</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">The next fenced block contains a line that looks like a slide separator:</span>

<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">Paragraph before a thematic break.</span>
<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">---</span>
<span style="color:rgb(0,205,0);">Paragraph after a thematic break inside an example.</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">The deck must keep this entire fenced block on one slide.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Quoted Thematic Break</span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">This quote contains a thematic-looking line:</span></span></span>
<span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">---</span></span></span>
<span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span>
<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(127,127,127);">&gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">It is quoted content and should remain on the current slide.</span></span></span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">The actual slide separator is the unquoted thematic break after this slide.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># List Thematic Break</span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">List item before an indented thematic-looking line.</span></span></span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">  </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">---</span></span></span>

<span class="mdf-line"><span class="mdf-prefix"><span style="color:rgb(0,205,205);font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;">-</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> </span></span><span class="mdf-content"><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">List item after the indented line.</span></span></span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">The indented line belongs to the list context and should not split slides unless the Markdown parser classifies it as a block-level thematic break outside the container.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Raw HTML</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">&lt;p data-deck-fixture=&#34;raw-html&#34;&gt;Raw inline HTML is escaped and rendered as text according to existing HTML renderer rules.&lt;/p&gt;</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">&lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;Disclosure content&lt;/summary&gt; This is intentionally shown as escaped text rather than a live disclosure. &lt;/details&gt;</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Links And Interaction</span>

<a href="https://example.com/docs"><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">Primary documentation link</span></a>

<a href="https://example.com/docs/deck/mode/long/link"><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">A longer link label that wraps across lines in narrow viewports</span></a>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Link activation should not accidentally advance the deck. Focus should remain usable on the current slide only.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Image Syntax</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">!</span><span style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">Tiny transparent pixel</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">This exercises Markdown image output without requiring network access. The image is intentionally tiny so it does not dominate the slide.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Long Word Pressure</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">The renderer should avoid layout explosions from a long token:</span>

<span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">supercalifragilisticexpialidocious-supercalifragilisticexpialidocious-supercalifragilisticexpialidocious</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Normal prose after the long token should remain visible.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Escapes And Entity Text</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Escaped punctuation should remain readable as literal text: </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">*not emphasis*</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">[not a link]</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, and </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);"># not a heading</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">.</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">Entity-looking text should also remain readable: </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">AT&amp;amp;T</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">&amp;lt;tag&amp;gt;</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, and </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">10&amp;nbsp;000</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;font-size:22pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:3ch;">## Second-Level Slide Header</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">This slide starts with a </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">##</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> ATX heading instead of </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">#</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">. The deck renderer should still treat it as the slide header and keep the body content below it.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(205,0,205);font-weight:700;font-size:15pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:4ch;">### Third-Level Slide Header</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">This slide starts with a </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">###</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);"> ATX heading. It verifies that lower-level first headings can act as slide headers without inheriting body centering behavior.</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(0,205,0);font-weight:700;font-size:32pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:2ch;"># Final Slide</span>

<span class="mdf-heading" style="color:rgb(59,156,255);font-weight:700;font-size:22pt;font-weight:700;--mdf-heading-indent:3ch;">## End State</span>

<span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">This slide verifies </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">End</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, </span><span style="color:rgb(205,0,205);">G</span><span style="color:rgb(220,220,220);">, URL hash restoration, and slide number rendering near the end of the deck.</span>
</main>
</body>
</html>
